--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/quiet-pans-store.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"saleor-dashboard": patch
+---
+
+Staff can now set "Storage conditions" (up to 250 characters, e.g. "Keep refrigerated at 2–8 °C") when creating a product and on the product page, and translate it per language on the product translations page.
diff --git a/agents/IMPLEMENTATION.md b/agents/IMPLEMENTATION.md
index c6216fb89..69d966666 100644
--- a/agents/IMPLEMENTATION.md
+++ b/agents/IMPLEMENTATION.md
@@ -21,3 +21,9 @@ For detailed change history, use git history and PRs instead of expanding this f
 ### Rosetta workspace documentation: done, 2026-10-21
 
 - Added `docs/CONTEXT.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/ASSUMPTIONS.md`, `docs/TODO.md`, `agents/IMPLEMENTATION.md` and `agents/MEMORY.md`, alongside the Phase 3 `docs/TECHSTACK.md`, `docs/CODEMAP.md` and `docs/DEPENDENCIES.md`. The human docs were left untouched.
+
+### Product storage conditions: done, 2026-10-21
+
+- Schema refresh (`schema-main.graphql`, +50 lines) + codegen; field selected with `@lockSchema(schema: "main")` in `src/fragments/products.ts`, `translations.ts`, `src/translations/mutations.ts`.
+- Input in `ProductDetailsForm` (250 limit, main schema only), form data/payload (`data.ts`, `handlers/utils.ts`, `saveComposition.ts`); translation field via `createGeneralNameDescriptionSection`. Create flow: `/products/add` redirects to `CreateProductDialog` on the list; optional input there is passed through `createMinimalProduct` to `productCreate`. (`ProductCreatePage/form.tsx` is an unused legacy hook, left untouched.)
+- Changeset `quiet-pans-store.md`; tests added next to each changed module.
diff --git a/docs/CONTEXT.md b/docs/CONTEXT.md
